OL,3,GNEWSAHotel to stop housing asylum
OL,4,Aseekers, MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel that has been the scene of
OL,7,Fanti-immigration demonstrations and
OL,8,Fcounter-protests over the last two
OL,9,Fyears will stop housing asylum seekers,
OL,10,Fthe local MP has said.
OL,12,FLabour's Conor Rand confirmed the
OL,13,F148-bedroom Cresta Court in Altrincham,
OL,14,FGreater Manchester, would "end housing
OL,15,Fasylum seekers within the next three
OL,16,Fmonths as the remaining residents are
OL,17,Fmoved out of the hotel".
OL,19,FThe local Conservative group claimed
OL,20,Fthe decision came off the back of its
OL,21,F"two years of relentless campaigning".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
