OL,3,GNEWSAHotel to stop housing asylum
OL,4,Aseekers, MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Home Office said
OL,7,Fthe closure was part of its policy of
OL,8,F"closing every asylum hotel and moving
OL,9,Fasylum seekers into alternative
OL,10,Faccommodation, including former
OL,11,Fmilitary sites".
